Subject: [PATCH 1/1] PCI:qcom:ep: Add support for SCMI based PCIe EPC for
 sa8787p

Add support for sa8787p for SCMI based Endpoint Controller.

Change-Id: Ifee10ef6194253894a07f346c2d0bc2464d6bd73
Signed-off-by: Nitesh Gupta <nitegupt@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 drivers/pci/controller/dwc/pcie-qcom-ep.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/pci/controller/dwc/pcie-qcom-ep.c b/drivers/pci/controller/dwc/pcie-qcom-ep.c
index 9336d79cd07a..6e723f450e0d 100644
